  narrativeCategory: 2
  dialogueLines:
  - subtitleText: This symbolic memorial stone is dedicated to the sisters Anne and
      Margot Frank, who died here in March 1945. It was actually erected much later,
      in June 1999, on the initiative of their cousin Buddy Elias for Anne's seventieth
      birthday.
